#question(title: [Estimations -- 2], centered: true)[
  Without using a calculator, estimate
  $display(root(20, 1.01))$ as well as you
  can.

  #emph[Hint:] You know the value of
  $display(f(x) = root(20, x))$ and its
  derivative at one point very close to 1.01.
  Use the tangent line at that point as an
  approximation.
]
